class="tp">1876–1967</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/octavio-paz"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/octavio-paz.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Octavio Paz</span><span class="tp">1914–1998</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/patricio-aylwin"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/patricio-aylwin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Patricio Aylwin</span><span class="tp">1918–2016</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
